{
  "id": 309628701,
  "iid": 16056,
  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "Add support for LeakSanitizer.",
  "description": "ENABLE_LSAN now activates LeakSanitizer, available with both gcc and clang.\nLeakSanitizer functionality is included within AddressSanitizer by default,\nhowever if the performance impact of AddressSanitizer is undesirable, this\noption allows LeakSanitizer to be used on its own.\n\nThe existing CMake code for ASAN/TSAN/UBSAN support was used as the basis for\nadding LSAN support.\n\nThe NO_SANITIZE checking has been moved out from under ENABLE_ASAN so that the\nLemon parser generator is always excused from all sanitizing, rather than this\nbeing the case only when ENABLE_ASAN is set.  Without doing this, the known\nleaks in the Lemon parser generator will cause the build to fail when\nENABLE_LSAN is active.",
  "state": "merged",
